OL,3,GNEWSAStormont debates no-confidence
OL,4,Amotion in agriculture minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssembly members (MLAs) are debating a
OL,7,Fno-confidence motion in Agriculture and
OL,8,FEnvironment Minister Andrew Muir over a
OL,9,Fcontroversial cattle cull in County
OL,10,FTyrone.
OL,12,FThe cows were shot in land near
OL,13,FFivemiletown in County Tyrone in June,
OL,14,Fleading to complaints about the manner
OL,15,Fof the cull which was carried out
OL,16,Fwithin earshot of members of the
OL,17,Fpublic.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
