OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStormont debates no-confidence
OL,4,Amotion in agriculture minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn August, the Ulster Farmers' Union
OL,7,Fextended a vote of no confidence in the
OL,8,Fdepartment to include the minister, the
OL,9,Fpermanent secretary and the chief vet
OL,10,Fover how the cull was carried out.
OL,12,FMotions of no-confidence in the
OL,13,Fassembly are not binding even if a
OL,14,Fmajority of MLAs vote in favour of
OL,15,Fthem, and cannot automatically force a
OL,16,Fminister from office.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
